{"id":"002418bdd321687f","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-extrema.md","title":"Least and greatest extensions of a partial Boolean function","display":"df-extrema — Least and greatest extensions of a partial Boolean function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-extrema","aliases":["27-df-extrema"],"display":"df-extrema — Least and greatest extensions of a partial Boolean function","depends_on":["[[27-df-pdbf]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.2.1 equations (12.3)–(12.4)","source_printed_pages":"515","source_pdf_pages":"539","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-extrema"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-extrema</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-extrema — Least and greatest extensions of a partial Boolean function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea846f0a3813bc0e\" href=\"?note=ea846f0a3813bc0e\" title=\"27-df-pdbf\">27-df-pdbf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.2.1 equations (12.3)–(12.4)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"515"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"539"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\">\\((T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ea846f0a3813bc0e\" href=\"?note=ea846f0a3813bc0e\" title=\"27-df-pdbf\">27-df-pdbf</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f^-_{T,F}\\coloneqq\\{(a,1)\\mid a\\in T\\}\\cup\\{(a,0)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\setminus T\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f^-_{T,F}\\coloneqq\\{(a,1)\\mid a\\in T\\}\\cup\\{(a,0)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\setminus T\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f^+_{T,F}\\coloneqq\\{(a,0)\\mid a\\in F\\}\\cup\\{(a,1)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\setminus F\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f^+_{T,F}\\coloneqq\\{(a,0)\\mid a\\in F\\}\\cup\\{(a,1)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\setminus F\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>分别令未知点全为 0 或全为 1；两图的分支互斥且穷尽，因而给出总函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pdbf","status":"resolved","id":"ea846f0a3813bc0e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pdbf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pdbf","status":"resolved","id":"ea846f0a3813bc0e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pdbf]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n","display":false},{"tex":"f^-_{T,F}\\coloneqq\\{(a,1)\\mid a\\in T\\}\\cup\\{(a,0)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\setminus T\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"f^+_{T,F}\\coloneqq\\{(a,0)\\mid a\\in F\\}\\cup\\{(a,1)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\setminus F\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1102,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-218","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-extrema|df-extrema — Least and greatest extensions of a partial Boolean function]]"},{"id":"2ee99d9cb28cc6d3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；极端扩张见 [[27-df-extrema]]，扩张族见 [[27-df-extension]]；$g\\leq h$ 表示 $\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(g(a)\\leq h(a))$。"},{"id":"6164dd467b436ea1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；$f^-_{T,F}$ 见 [[27-df-extrema]]，$\\mathrm{Ext}$ 见 [[27-df-extension]]；$\\chi_T=f^-_{T,F}$。"},{"id":"f8b61370b9b75b32","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；见 [[27-df-pdbfpi]]、[[27-df-pattern]]、[[27-df-extrema]]、[[27-df-piset]]、[[27-df-impset]]。"}],"outgoing":["ea846f0a3813bc0e"]}